# Local secrets/config that should not be committed in the future
# (auth-config.js itself stays tracked: it only holds a public-safe Supabase
# publishable/anon key, and Cloudflare Pages deploys straight from this repo
# with no build step to inject it otherwise. Add new secret files here instead.)

